# UI

- Layout and chrome: **Tailwind classes in TSX**. Reuse `packages/components/editorial/tw.ts` (home/blog). Do not add new `.home-*` / `.rd-*` / `.site-header-*` CSS selectors.
- CSS files: **tokens only**. `:root` = light. **`.dark` only** for theme overrides. No `.light` class.
- One stylesheet per app: `@import "@duyet/components/styles.css"` then local tokens. Do not import Tailwind twice or load `styles.css` plus app CSS from JS.
- Fonts: `<link>` via `duyetFontHeadLinks()`, never `@import` Google Fonts in CSS.
- Default theme is light. Dark only when `localStorage.theme === "dark"`.
- Do not wrap `SiteHeader` / `SiteFooter` in `ClerkAuthProvider`. Import chrome from deep paths, not the `@duyet/components` barrel.
- `html { scrollbar-gutter: stable }`. Logos/favicons: `packages/components/brand/` (`DuyetLogo`, `duyetFaviconHeadLinks`).
